{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103360","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1410336001:0":{"text":"おお、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様、数日ぶりですな！","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA11642CFB116F8A9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"おお、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様、数日ぶりですな！","female":"おお、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>様、数日ぶりですな！","variant_male_record_index":"155645","variant_female_record_index":"155646","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410336002:1":{"text":"ここでお会いするとは思いませんでしたぞ。お体はもう大丈夫ですか？","source_cn":"没想到，能在这碰见……你们身体恢复了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC015E0CF54882929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410336003:1":{"text":"ご心配ありがとうございます。もう大丈夫ですよ。","source_cn":"谢谢你的关心，我们一切都好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05F22DBC8956B0F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410336004:2":{"text":"今回の視察はご満足いただけましたかな？よろしければもう少しご案内しますよ？","source_cn":"视察了一番，还满意吗？我再陪你们四处看看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x057C3B3B95BC1711","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1410336004":{"text":"今回の視察はご満足いただけましたかな？よろしければもう少しご案内しますよ？","source_cn":"视察了一番，还满意吗？我再陪你们四处看看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05